    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Two-Bedroom Apartment with Iconic Design & Panoramic Mountain Views\r\n\r\nSet on the high 5th floor within the landmark Cubes 1 building at Beacon South Quarter, No. 501 is a beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom 82 sq meter apartment that combines striking contemporary architecture with bright, stylish interiors and far-reaching views across Sandyford towards the Dublin Mountains.\r\n\r\nOne of the apartment's standout features is the signature projecting \"Cube\" design to the principal bedroom – an architectural element unique to this development that creates a spectacular floor-to-ceiling glazed corner, flooding the room with natural light while framing uninterrupted panoramic views across the surrounding skyline.\r\n\r\nThe spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area is designed for modern living and entertaining, with full-height glazing drawing in natural light throughout the day. A sleek contemporary kitchen features quality integrated appliances, generous storage and an island breakfast bar, while the living space flows effortlessly towards the balcony where the elevated outlook can be enjoyed year-round.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are generous doubles with built-in wardrobes, with the principal suite benefitting from a luxurious en-suite bathroom. The bathrooms are finished to an exceptionally high specification, featuring contemporary tiling, premium sanitary ware and elegant fittings. The main bathroom is further enhanced with colour-changing mood lighting, creating a spa-like atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThroughout the apartment, warm timber flooring complements the clean, modern aesthetic, while intelligent lighting controls in the living and kitchen areas add both ambience and convenience.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that perfectly balances design, comfort and location, offering an exceptional opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\nIconic high-floor apartment within The Cubes\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\r\nTwo contemporary bathrooms including principal en-suite\r\nSignature projecting Cube bedroom with panoramic glazing\r\nSpectacular views across Sandyford and the Dublin Mountains\r\nBright open-plan living and dining accommodation\r\nStylish modern kitchen with island and integrated appliances\r\nQuality timber flooring throughout\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes\r\nPremium bathroom finishes\r\nColour-changing mood lighting in the bathroom\r\nProgrammable lighting controls in the living room and kitchen\r\nLift access and secure modern development\r\n1 Designated Basement Car Parking Space\r\n\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n\r\nBeacon South Quarter has become one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential addresses, offering an unrivalled combination of convenience, connectivity and lifestyle. The development features an impressive range of amenities on your doorstep including cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, pharmacy, gym, banking facilities and a variety of retail outlets, creating a vibrant neighbourhood atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is ideally positioned beside Sandyford Business District, Central Park and Beacon Hospital, making it an excellent choice for  working in the area. Major employers including Microsoft, Mastercard, Vodafone and other multinational companies are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links ensure effortless commuting. The Stillorgan Luas Green Line stop is within a short walk, providing direct access to Dublin City Centre, Dundrum and Cherrywood. Numerous Dublin Bus routes also serve the area, while the M50 and N11 are only minutes away, offering superb connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nFor shopping and leisure, residents enjoy immediate access to the extensive retail and dining options within Beacon South Quarter, while Dundrum Town Centre, Stillorgan Village, Carrickmines Retail Park and Foxrock Village are all just a short drive away. The nearby Dublin Mountains provide endless opportunities for walking, cycling and outdoor recreation, offering the perfect balance between city convenience and natural surroundings.\r\n\r\n501 The Cubes 1 offers a rare opportunity to acquire a distinctive, architecturally designed apartment with exceptional views, high-quality finishes and one of South Dublin's most convenient and vibrant locations."
      },
